# Extra paths that send the task check to the FULL unit suite (never e2e).
# One extended regex per line, matched against the repo-relative path — for
# modules whose effect on tests the import graph cannot see (loaded by a test
# setup file, or global by design). package.json, lockfiles, tsconfig*,
# vitest/vite/eslint configs, test setup files, prisma/drizzle migrations and
# .env* are built into the script.
